    {
      "id": "AC-1",
      "source": "TP1-14482 AC1",
      "text": "Version History button in the visual editor toolbar opens a popup with a single visual node graph diff for the selected revision; YAML diff is a separate popup from the YAML panel (two entry points, no toggle)"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-2",
      "source": "TP1-14482 AC2",
      "text": "Visual diff modal renders one node graph for the target revision with one set of zoom in/out, fit-view and drag-to-pan controls"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-3",
      "source": "TP1-14482 AC3",
      "text": "Node in target revision but not in the compared version: green border/marker (added)"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-4",
      "source": "TP1-14482 AC4",
      "text": "Node removed vs compared version: shown at former position with red border, REMOVED badge above, strikethrough label"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-5",
      "source": "TP1-14482 AC5",
      "text": "Node in both with differing config: amber/distinct border as modified, without exposing changed values inline"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-6",
      "source": "TP1-14482 AC6",
      "text": "Visual diff is an alternative alongside (not replacing) the textual diff, always compares exactly two revisions, read-only"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-7",
      "source": "TP1-14482 AC7",
      "text": "Restoring a version from YAML or Visual popup triggers Save-equivalent validation in background on restored content; issues inline; restore not reverted; nothing persisted"
    },
    {
      "id": "TR-1",
      "source": "TP1-14482 Technical Requirements",
      "text": "POST /v1/workflows/{workflow_id}/validate runs the complete pre-persist pipeline (MCP access control, autonomous-mode guard, executor validation, guardrail existence/project/permission); 200 with advisory warnings or same structured errors as update"
    },
    {
      "id": "TR-2",
      "source": "TP1-14482 Technical Requirements",
      "text": "Validate endpoint performs no database write (full dry-run)"
    },
    {
      "id": "TR-3",
      "source": "TP1-15045 scope items 13/14 (derived)",
      "text": "Access, not-found and malformed-config handling of validate matches update (403/404/400)"
    },
    {
      "id": "REG-1",
      "source": "TP1-15045 scope item 15; TP1-8827",
      "text": "Existing workflow versioning / text diff behaviour is not regressed"
    }
  ],
